| 8 | reach | chunk k=2 | 2.99 | 2.67 | 0.31 |
| 8 | reach | chunk k=4 | 2.92 | 2.67 | 0.24 |
| 8 | reach | chunk k=8 | 2.68 | 2.67 | 0.00 |
| 40 | reach | chunk k=1 | 6.49 | 4.42 | 2.08 |
| 40 | reach | chunk k=2 | 4.52 | 4.42 | 0.10 |

